#: ../../getting_started/requirements/opensearch_configuration.rst:4
msgid ""
"Starting with |morpheus| 8.1.0, the embedded search service changes from "
"Elasticsearch to OpenSearch. All HPE Morpheus VM Essentials Software "
"versions already use OpenSearch — this change only affects |morpheus| "
"appliance upgrades. Hewlett Packard Enterprise continues to support both "
"Elasticsearch and OpenSearch for external clusters."
msgstr ""
"Starting con |morpheus| 8.1.0, the embedded search service changes desde "
"Elasticsearch to OpenSearch. All HPE Morpheus VM Essentials Software "
"versions already use OpenSearch — this change solo affects |morpheus| "
"appliance upgrades. Hewlett Packard Enterprise continues to support ambos "
"Elasticsearch y OpenSearch for externo clusters."

