#: ../../getting_started/requirements/opensearch_configuration.rst:343
msgid "Upgrading from a 3-Node Elasticsearch Cluster"
msgstr "Upgrading desde a 3-Node Elasticsearch Cluster"

#: ../../getting_started/requirements/opensearch_configuration.rst:347
msgid ""
"Install the new Morpheus package on all 3 nodes. Do **not** run "
"reconfigure yet. The preinstall script preserves the Elasticsearch "
"installation at ``/var/opt/morpheus/elasticsearch-8.15.5/home/``. The ES "
"data and binaries are preserved across package install, reconfigure, and "
"normal operation, thus, the migration export can be run at any time until"
" the ES data and binaries are removed with the export cleanup option (or "
"manually removed)."
msgstr ""
"Install the nuevo Morpheus package on todos 3 nodes. Do **not** run "
"reconfigure yet. The preinstall script preserves the Elasticsearch "
"installation at ``/var/opt/morpheus/elasticsearch-8.15.5/home/``. The ES "
"data y binaries are preserved across package install, reconfigure, y "
"normal operation, thus, the migration export puede ser run at cualquier "
"time until the ES data y binaries are removed con the export cleanup "
"option (or manually removed)."

#: ../../getting_started/requirements/opensearch_configuration.rst:349
msgid "**Step 2 — Check the ES cluster configuration**"
msgstr "**Step 2 — Check the ES cluster configuration**"

#: ../../getting_started/requirements/opensearch_configuration.rst:351
msgid ""
"Run ``cat "
"/var/opt/morpheus/elasticsearch-8.15.5/home/config/elasticsearch.yml`` "
"and note the ``discovery.seed_hosts`` and "
"``cluster.initial_master_nodes``. These are the cluster nodes."
msgstr ""
"Run ``cat "
"/var/opt/morpheus/elasticsearch-8.15.5/home/config/elasticsearch.yml`` y "
"note the ``discovery.seed_hosts`` y ``cluster.initial_master_nodes``. "
"These are the cluster nodes."

#: ../../getting_started/requirements/opensearch_configuration.rst:353
msgid "**Step 3 — Start Elasticsearch on all nodes**"
msgstr "**Step 3 — Start Elasticsearch on todos los nodos**"

#: ../../getting_started/requirements/opensearch_configuration.rst:355
msgid ""
"Start ES on each node within 30 seconds of each other. The order does not"
" matter, they will discover each other:"
msgstr ""
"Start ES on each node dentro de 30 seconds of each other. The order does "
"not matter, they will discover each other:"

#: ../../getting_started/requirements/opensearch_configuration.rst:357
msgid ""
"su -s /bin/bash es-morpheus -c "
"'ES_JAVA_HOME=/var/opt/morpheus/elasticsearch-8.15.5/home/jdk "
"/var/opt/morpheus/elasticsearch-8.15.5/home/bin/elasticsearch -d'"
msgstr ""
"su -s /bin/bash es-morpheus -c "
"'ES_JAVA_HOME=/var/opt/morpheus/elasticsearch-8.15.5/home/jdk "
"/var/opt/morpheus/elasticsearch-8.15.5/home/bin/elasticsearch -d'"

