msgstr "Upgrading con an External Cluster"

#: ../../getting_started/requirements/opensearch_configuration.rst:430
msgid ""
"If the existing Morpheus installation was already configured to use an "
"external Elasticsearch or OpenSearch cluster, the upgrade is "
"straightforward — no data migration is needed on the appliance side since"
" the data lives on the external cluster. The external cluster does not "
"need to be migrated to OpenSearch; Morpheus supports both."
msgstr ""
"If the existing Morpheus installation was already configured to use an "
"external Elasticsearch o OpenSearch cluster, the upgrade is "
"straightforward — no data migration is needed en la appliance side since "
"the data lives en la external cluster. The external cluster does not "
"necesitan ser migrated to OpenSearch; Morpheus supports both."

#: ../../getting_started/requirements/opensearch_configuration.rst:434
msgid "Install the new Morpheus package on each appliance node."
msgstr "Install el nuevo Morpheus package on each appliance node."

#: ../../getting_started/requirements/opensearch_configuration.rst:436
msgid "**Step 2 — Reconfigure**"
msgstr "**Step 2 — Reconfigure**"

#: ../../getting_started/requirements/opensearch_configuration.rst:438
msgid ""
"No ``morpheus.rb`` changes are needed. The existing "
"``elasticsearch[...]`` settings are bridged automatically."
msgstr ""
"No ``morpheus.rb`` changes are needed. The existente "
"``elasticsearch[...]`` settings are bridged automatically."

